OL,3,GNEWSAPart of M62 reopens after vehicle
OL,4,Aoverturns
OL,5,
OL,6,FA section of the M62 motorway in West
OL,7,FYorkshire has reopened after a crash.
OL,9,FThe eastbound carriageway between
OL,10,Fjunctions 22 and 24, near Huddersfield,
OL,11,Fwas closed following an earlier
OL,12,Fcollision.
OL,14,FNational Highways said the crash
OL,15,Finvolved an overturned vehicle and
OL,16,Fconfirmed all three lanes had reopened.
OL,18,FThe company warned drivers that delays
OL,19,Fwere continuing between junctions 21
OL,20,Fand 22.
